    "system": {
        "description": {
            "gm": "",
            "value": "<p>This armor upgrade adds a reserve air supply to your armor which helps filter out common contaminants, including protection from most toxic atmospheres.</p><p>This upgrades the air supply's valves to extend its protection against extreme pressure. This upgrade protects against severely thick and severely thin atmospheres, vacuum, and breathing while submerged in non-hazardous liquid.</p><p>Your armor's Environmental Protection also protects against suffocation from smoke inhalation and severely toxic atmospheres.</p><p>You gain a +4 status bonus to Fortitude saves against inhaled and olfactory effects.</p>"
